{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36299","headline":"雪中寄李知诲判官 · 方干","name":"雪中寄李知诲判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"聚散联翩急复迟，解将华髪两相欺。\n虽云竹重先藏路，却讶巢倾不损枝。\n入户便从风起後，照窗翻似月明时。\n此时门巷无行迹，尘满尊罍谁得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}